  "notes": "13 CSS custom properties, e.g. --red-0, --red-1, --red-2, --red-3.\n\nUse: npm i open-props, then @import \"open-props/red\" (or copy the variables).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/argyleink/open-props/blob/main/src/props.red.css",
  "code": "<style>\n:where(html) {\n  --red-0: #fff5f5;\n  --red-1: #ffe3e3;\n  --red-2: #ffc9c9;\n  --red-3: #ffa8a8;\n  --red-4: #ff8787;\n  --red-5: #ff6b6b;\n  --red-6: #fa5252;\n  --red-7: #f03e3e;\n  --red-8: #e03131;\n  --red-9: #c92a2a;\n  --red-10: #b02525;\n  --red-11: #962020;\n  --red-12: #7d1a1a;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Open Props red</strong>\n<p>red</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fff5f5\" title=\"--red-0: #fff5f5\"><span>0</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffe3e3\" title=\"--red-1: #ffe3e3\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffc9c9\" title=\"--red-2: #ffc9c9\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffa8a8\" title=\"--red-3: #ffa8a8\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#ff8787\" title=\"--red-4: #ff8787\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#ff6b6b\" title=\"--red-5: #ff6b6b\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#fa5252\" title=\"--red-6: #fa5252\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#f03e3e\" title=\"--red-7: #f03e3e\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#e03131\" title=\"--red-8: #e03131\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#c92a2a\" title=\"--red-9: #c92a2a\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#b02525\" title=\"--red-10: #b02525\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#962020\" title=\"--red-11: #962020\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#7d1a1a\" title=\"--red-12: #7d1a1a\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
